    "justification": "empirical study (corrected ARI across seeds, silhouette, per-cluster marker |t|) showed direct k-means on log-PCA outperformed spectral clustering on the KNN graph: it recovers a stable, balanced, nested 2+2 structure (cluster sizes sum exactly to the dataset's two main groups 382/418) with strong markers (max |t| 14-17); spectral clustering left the graph dominated by the single bipartition and gave imbalanced partitions (ARI vs k-means 0.09-0.5)"
  },
  "pseudotime": {
